WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.748
A real reply pauses for two approval questions.

00:00:08.748 --> 00:00:12.104
Answer the complete batch before resuming.

00:00:12.104 --> 00:00:16.734
Resume sends both answers and continues the same turn.

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:18.432
Resume complete.

00:00:18.432 --> 00:00:22.856
A new turn gets a new approval batch.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:28.042
Read-only replay.

00:00:28.042 --> 00:00:30.200
Back live. Paused.
